  "title": "The Note With a Broken Tether",
  "family": "learning",
  "category": "learning/study",
  "premise": "A researcher wants to reuse a striking claim, but its note has lost the original source and surrounding context. Reattaching a citation card and checking the passage distinguishes support from speculation.",
